{"attempt_id": "MATH-20260822-138753-DX-SIGN", "capture_schema_version": "math-fast-intake-capture-v2", "content_hash": "2680f7b570e7250e2ef15bf1f990e02021789ee9d1eb8fa8575db74547cf5c69", "episode_evidence": {"solution_text": "题目标识 138753。曲线参数为 x=cosθ，y=sinθ，z=θ，θ∈[0,2π]。因此 dx=-sinθ dθ，dy=cosθ dθ，dz=dθ。第一项应为 (cos²θ-θsinθ)(-sinθ)dθ=(-sinθcos²θ+θsin²θ)dθ；原计算把这一整项的符号写反。其余两项分别为 (sin²θcosθ-θcos²θ)dθ 与 (θ²-sinθcosθ)dθ。含一次 θ 的两项合并为 θ(sin²θ-cos²θ)=-θcos2θ，其在 [0,2π] 上积分为 0；其余三个纯三角函数项积分也为 0。故积分只剩 ∫₀²π θ²dθ，结果为 8π³/3。", "teaching_turns": [{"kind": "reasoning", "origin": "user_observed", "speaker": "user", "text": "直接从参数定义下手，判断纯三角函数项积分为零，最后得到 8π³/3-2π²。"}, {"kind": "correction", "origin": "assistant_explained", "speaker": "assistant", "text": "指出 dx=-sinθ dθ，故第一项应为 -sinθcos²θ+θsin²θ；原展开的两个符号均相反。"}, {"kind": "explanation", "origin": "assistant_explained", "speaker": "assistant", "text": "说明 θ(sin²θ-cos²θ)=-θcos2θ，且该项在 [0,2π] 上积分为零。"}], "user_answer_text": "用户直接参数化 x=cosθ，y=sinθ，z=θ，并把线积分化为 θ 从 0 到 2π 的定积分；其展开式把第一项写成 sinθcos²θ-θsin²θ，因此得到 8π³/3-2π²。"}, "event_id": "MFI-CAP-7b84f5dee8bc2846f5431c58", "event_type": "capture", "evidence": {"first_break": {"kind": "expression", "origin": "assistant_inferred", "text": "代入 dx=-sinθ dθ 时漏用了负号，使 (x²-yz)dx 展开后的两项符号全部相反。"}, "hints_needed": [{"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "需要逐项写出 dx、dy、dz 并核对第一项的乘法符号。"}, {"origin": "assistant_explained", "text": "需要用 cos2θ=cos²θ-sin²θ 判断剩余含 θ 项的积分。"}], "independent_correct_steps": [{"origin": "user_observed", "text": "正确选取参数 x=cosθ，y=sinθ，z=θ，θ∈[0,2π]。"}, {"origin": "user_observed", "text": "正确判断三个不含 θ 因子的纯三角函数项在完整周期上的积分为零。"}], "later_breaks": [], "mastery_score": 3, "mastery_source": "assistant_assessed", "result": "wrong", "score_basis": {"origin": "assistant_inferred", "text": "经直接纠错后表示题目已无问题，但本轮未观察到独立重算。"}, "self_corrections": [], "unresolved": [], "user_facts": [{"origin": "user_observed", "text": "用户采用曲线参数直接代入线积分的方法。"}, {"origin": "user_observed", "text": "用户原计算得到 8π³/3-2π²，并主动核对与标准答案的差异。"}, {"origin": "user_confirmed", "text": "纠错后用户表示这道题已无问题。"}]}, "idempotency_key": "7b84f5dee8bc2846f5431c5855f8c7097830a8e0e67081167d15c95f817b313b", "initial_state": "pending_nightly", "payload_hash": "f28a71271940c5c0ff31d1d82d966430230ad1779aa76a9f8533c5adde9f78ac", "recorded_at": "2026-08-22T11:29:31+08:00", "requested_action": "record_wrong", "schema_version": "math-fast-intake-ledger-v1", "score_ref": null, "source_bundle": {"manifest_hash": "5b516745a26785b9f492cec9714cff6419fdf2e0e083269f60e95d685d5d544d", "manifest_path": "数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-22/44c5e1afebdced03f8c4f708/manifest.json", "source_locator": "题目标识:138753", "study_date": "2026-08-22"}, "study_date": "2026-08-22", "target": {"formal_id": null, "identity_state": "source_backed", "kind": "new_source", "source_hash_before": "5b516745a26785b9f492cec9714cff6419fdf2e0e083269f60e95d685d5d544d", "source_locator": "题目标识:138753"}, "thread_ref": null}
